[{"title":"禳田","author":"胡奎","text":"坎坎鼓，祀田祖。\n新酒在盂豚在簠，阿翁呼孙儿馌妇。\n拜跪祈神降田所，愿神再三听祝语。\n五日一风十日雨，穰穰满家多黍稌。\n往来野田无雀鼠，出入道路无豺虎。\n丁男在家应门户，先祈一半输官府。\n神今有食农有土，常年力作甘辛苦。\n春秋报神神莫负。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56026,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伤田家","author":"胡奎","text":"低田水深愁没稻，高陇地乾多稗草。\n地势由来苦不平，农家辛苦何时了。\n低田车水出下塘，高陇翻江朝夕忙。\n秋来雨多禾耳黑，县吏索租催上仓。\n东家借米依程限，剜却心头医得眼。\n宁教借米倍还人，莫遣打门官吏瞋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56027,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张京兆","author":"胡奎","text":"摇摇珂佩堤上归，朝回无事但画眉。\n莺啼落花昼不飞，美人照镜愁春闺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56028,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卓文君","author":"胡奎","text":"郎乘车，妾御马。\n东郭门前绿杨下。\n郎乘马，妾御车，长安道边花满株。\n马翩翩，车轧轧，二月上林花正发。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56029,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杞良妻","author":"胡奎","text":"一哭长城裂，再哭长城崩。\n长城窟中水，夜夜闻啼声。\n哀哀双泪血，洒向城上月。\n长城若不倾，何由见夫骨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56030,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自君之出矣","author":"胡奎","text":"自君之出矣，我琴不曾弹。\n弦中哀与乐，只在转指间。\n自君之出矣，蛾眉向谁画。\n思君如明镜，挂在东窗下。\n自君之出矣，夜夜卜灯花。\n思君如车轮，何时碾到家。\n自君之出矣，一望一回头。\n思君如辘轳，展转何时休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56031,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"公无渡河","author":"胡奎","text":"公无渡河，河流如雪山，出门滔天行路难。\n公不听妾语，被发徉狂向何许。\n公今渡河妾无主，妾弹箜篌泪如雨。\n公无渡河，水有鼋鼍。\n公今欲渡，妾当奈何。\n公无渡河，水有蛟龙。\n公今欲渡，妾安所从。\n陆则有车，水则有舟。\n公今溺流，妾弹箜篌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56032,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"妾安所居二首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"贱妾安所居，所居在中堂。\n女子不出门，肯离慈母傍。\n十三学织素，绣得金鸳鸯。\n十五嫁夫婿，佩以双明珰。\n一朝复一朝，芙蓉照秋镜。\n自倚颜如花，不识郎心性。\n嫁鸡逐鸡飞，郎情与妾违。\n愿为松柏树，长附女萝衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56033,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"妾安所居二首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"贱妾安所居，所居在空闺。\n女子不出门，颜色无人知。\n一朝嫁夫婿，未几生别离。\n流水逝不返，浮云无定姿。\n妾居非无所，妾心良独苦。\n愿如松上萝，不离树根土。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56034,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"妾薄命","author":"胡奎","text":"妾薄命，何足嗟。\n妾愿如墙下草，不愿学风中花。\n风花漂泊无定所，墙下草生长在家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56035,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"铜雀妓二首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"高高铜雀台，望望西陵墓。\n翠辇不归来，空帏愁日暮。\n花落不返柯，水流无回波。\n月初与十五，歌舞奈君何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56036,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"铜雀妓二首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"高台悲风生，望望西陵道。\n昨日宫中花，今朝墓前草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56037,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小垂手","author":"胡奎","text":"朗月生瑶海，华星度绛河。\n美人小垂手，广袖舞傞傞。\n歌阑明烛短，舞罢落花多。\n平旦临鸾镜，脩眉抹翠蛾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56038,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沐浴子","author":"胡奎","text":"沐发恶蒙尘，振衣贵自洁。\n何以清我心，长空有明月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56039,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望夫石","author":"胡奎","text":"妾心化石石不转，妾身化石石不移。\n身心与石若可转，千里万里夫当归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56040,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望乡台","author":"胡奎","text":"一登还一望，一望复惆怅。\n乡关望不见，泪落荒台上。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56041,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长安道二首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"长安道，长安道上多芳草。\n一株杨柳驿门前，朝迎官马暮迎船。\n来船去马无閒日，人笑人歌年复年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56042,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长安道二首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"长安道，南北东西尘浩浩。\n车轮朝碾长安花，马蹄暮蹋长安草。\n黄金白璧如丘山，买官未得不肯还。\n不及终军年最少，弃繻生出玉门关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56043,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上留田","author":"胡奎","text":"上留田，上有白日与青天。\n人言弟死兄不?，他人野祭孤坟前。\n一雁入缯缴，群雁鸣声哀。\n如何骨肉亲，弃之委蒿莱。\n淮南徒闻歌尺布，田家无复栽荆树。\n上留田，良可怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56044,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"巫山高","author":"胡奎","text":"巫山高，青入天。\n丹崖翠谷相钩连，中有玉妃凌紫烟。\n凌紫烟，过楚宫，药房蕙幄春融融。\n琼台银阙与天通，朝云暮雨无终穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56045,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登高丘望远海","author":"胡奎","text":"登高丘，望远海。\n昆崙桃花千岁红，阿母蛾眉青不改。\n金鳌戴出三蓬莱，徐家楼船安在哉。\n鲸涛无梁不可渡，坐见浅浅浮黄埃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56046,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关山月二首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"关山月，昨夜团圆今夜缺。\n他乡月与故乡同，何苦征夫久离别。\n有客南来报捷音，为说良人戍桂林。\n若使仙家能缩地，便须一刻比千金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56047,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关山月二首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"明明天上月，照妾绮窗间。\n梦随明月去，不省在关山。\n关山月若知人意，送妾良人及早还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56048,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"薤上露","author":"胡奎","text":"薤上露，朝日晞，昨日相见今日违。\n力拔山，气如虎。\n朝日晞，薤上露。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56049,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见新月","author":"胡奎","text":"下阶拜新月，比妾镜中眉。\n郎在天涯见，莫忘初画时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56050,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上山采蘼芜","author":"胡奎","text":"上山采蘼芜，本是王孙草。\n王孙去不归，妾颜为谁好。\n磨砖作明镜，照妾不见容。\n年年湘水上，洒泪向春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56051,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南可采莲","author":"胡奎","text":"江南可采莲，中有木兰船。\n妾愁莲菂苦，郎爱露珠圆。\n珠圆不长好，菂苦向谁道。\n愿为泥中藕，洁身恒自保。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56052,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"折杨柳","author":"胡奎","text":"一折一断肠，再折再回首。\n平生故人泪，并落尊中酒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56053,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"折杨柳送人之京","author":"胡奎","text":"江头折杨柳，一枝赠一人。\n去年枝欲尽，今年枝又新。\n折柳莫折短，短条容易断。\n如何离别情，苦被春风管。\n折柳当折长，长条为马鞭。\n上林春色好，相约凤池边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56054,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双桐生","author":"胡奎","text":"双桐生古井，井上桐花落。\n妾心如辘轳，繫在青丝索。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56055,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芳树","author":"胡奎","text":"青青道傍树，飞花委道傍。\n不恋道傍土，一夕随风翔。\n高飞上青天，低飞入流水。\n花性自飘扬，孰谓因风起。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56056,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东海有珊瑚","author":"胡奎","text":"东海有珊瑚，乃在龙伯宫。\n托根蓬莱石，丹霞绚晴虹。\n铁网求之无底谷，一朝置在黄金屋。\n石家富儿不识珍，如意一击同飞尘。\n岂如阆苑蟠桃树，一花一实三千春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56057,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜长","author":"胡奎","text":"秋夜长，秋月光，月色照见罗衣裳。\n美人盈盈立秋霜，琼楼玉宇遥相望。\n明河迢迢鹊无梁，天高海阔思茫茫。\n思茫茫，秋夜长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56058,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟一日复一日","author":"胡奎","text":"一日复一日，一朝复一朝。\n欲识去来心，钱唐江上潮。\n潮去不待送，潮来不待招。\n潮来复潮去，使我心摇摇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56059,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟一日白一发","author":"胡奎","text":"一日白一发，况在九年间。\n请持蟠龙镜，照子冰雪颜。\n发白何足惜，故人难再得。\n有使即寄书，无使长相忆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56060,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"久别离","author":"胡奎","text":"近别三日尚思家，久别万里令人嗟。\n他乡春色岂不好，那如故园桃杏花。\n故园桃杏去时种，花落花开谁与共。\n桃杏今年已过墙，良人何事不思乡。\n久别离，愁断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56061,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远别离","author":"胡奎","text":"远别离，天有参商之二星。\n东西相隔数万里，中有一带天河横。\n天河水流直到海，织女牵牛两相待。\n早知离别如参商，不用灵鹊为河梁。\n宁为参商不相识，庶免郁郁愁中肠。\n河可填，海可塞，别离之恨无终极。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56062,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远如期二首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"去时愁远别，别久竟忘归。\n五见门前树，秋风落叶飞。\n落叶萦愁思，纷纷若乱丝。\n仙家能缩地，莫使阻归期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56063,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远如期二首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"去时期一载，不道又三秋。\n待得郎回日，松花满陇头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56064,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远将归二首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"一日白一发，一年三百茎。\n在家梳头霜满镜，何况远归千里程。\n去时道远归渐近，人生谁不恋乡井。\n昨夜青灯寒结花，远人明日当还家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56065,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远将归二首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"朝闻灵鹊语，夕见青灯花。\n空闺占吉梦，远客将还家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56066,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行路难","author":"胡奎","text":"出门登山无太行，出门涉水无瞿唐。\n太行羊肠九折坂，谁道车轮去不返。\n瞿唐虎须千丈渊，谁道此中能覆船。\n惟有人心不可测，当面波澜与荆棘。\n我欲剪荆棘、平波澜，出门莫歌行路难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56067,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"车遥遥二首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"鸦啼金井东方白，起送关山远行客。\n前车轧轧后车催，莫问东西与南北。\n天上日月无停轮，有泪不洒车中尘。\n黄尘如海车如水，出门遥遥千万里。\n相思日夜听车声，归时还待鸦啼起。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56068,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"车遥遥二首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"车遥遥，上青天，门前路，直如弦。\n茫茫名利途，谁斲车轮圆。\n安得两轮生四角，朝朝相见心即乐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56069,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"车遥遥送人之京","author":"胡奎","text":"车遥遥，云路长。\n车轮不生角，马蹄安得方。\n英英冠玉车中郎，欲行不行官道傍。\n我辕西行无鸟道，我辙北上无羊肠。\n平明起拂车上霜，金鸡叫日升榑桑。\n避尘有巾雨有盖，无疾无驱镇相待。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56070,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨霖铃","author":"胡奎","text":"雨霖铃，铃声杂雨随车行。\n鸟道西来与天平，不闻华清环佩声。\n白发梨园吹觱篥，望京楼上空相忆。\n惟有张徽识此情，御前曾教雨霖铃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56071,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秦罗敷","author":"胡奎","text":"昔有邯郸女，艳色世无如。\n手提青丝笼，采桑城南隅。\n头上金雀钗，耳傍明月珠。\n素手挽柔条，风吹绣罗襦。\n使君驰五马，冠盖丽且都。\n桑间问彼姝，云是秦罗敷。\n裴回日将夕，命妾载后车。\n长跪谢使君，妾有堂上姑。\n剖竹节乃直，裂松心不枯。\n使君善自爱，妾志终弗渝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56072,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五杂组","author":"胡奎","text":"五杂组，故园花。\n去复还，返哺鸦。\n不获已，远思家。\n五杂组，身上衣。\n去复还，梭上机。\n不获已，久思归。\n五杂组，园中花。\n去复还，道上车。\n不得已，久思家。\n五杂组，金缕罗。\n往复还，机上梭。\n不得已，阻关河。\n五杂组，斑斓衣。\n往复还，乌哺儿。\n不得已，久思归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56073,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"染丝上春机","author":"胡奎","text":"吴蚕八茧缫长丝，玉纤染云上春机。\n大姑爱织榴花色，小姑爱织梨花白。\n小姑回头语大姑，梨花洁白不受污。\n大姑榴花故自好，以色娱人岂长保。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56074,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"两头纤纤 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"两头纤纤梭上机，半白半黑枰上棋。\n腷腷膊膊啄木儿，磊磊落落曙星稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56075,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"两头纤纤 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"两头纤纤月初生，半白半黑天未明。\n腷腷膊膊断肠声，磊磊落落东方星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56076,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莫洗红","author":"胡奎","text":"莫洗红，洗红红渐少。\n郎爱新红鲜，妾怜旧红好。\n少妇回看机上丝，笑言还胜未红时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56077,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将进酒三首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"弹鹍弦，调凤琯，玉醅滟滟流霞煖。\n东方风来吹落花，随风漂泊天之涯。\n去年花谢今年发，今朝人醉明朝别。\n明朝别去可奈何，且尽花前金叵罗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56078,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将进酒三首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"四座且勿喧，听我歌长谣。\n百年三万六千夜，百年三万六千朝。\n三万六千朝与夜，几度花开与花谢。\n杯行到手请勿辞，金尽床头莫论价。\n不见洛阳城里人，化为北邙山下尘。\n今朝共饮碧玉醑，明日更漉乌纱巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56079,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将进酒三首 其三","author":"胡奎","text":"将进酒，酒进君莫停。\n我有长歌君试听。\n地有酒泉，天有酒星。\n不持寸铁，直破愁城。\n将进酒，酒进君莫止。\n我有长歌君侧耳。\n白日西飞，沧波东逝。\n古来达人，皆止于此。\n将进酒，请君听我歌。\n我欲长绳繫白日，精卫填沧波。\n沧波不可填，白日不可繫，进酒当君莫辞醉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56080,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辞欢伯","author":"胡奎","text":"彼欢伯兮何仇。\n吾将汝兮解忧。\n汝何为兮我尤。\n眵吾之睫兮翳吾之眸。\n我思汝由。\n汝莫我留。\n我不汝谋。\n我目其瘳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56081,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"提葫芦","author":"胡奎","text":"碧酒白玉壶，金钱花下沽。\n无情花间鸟，更唤提葫芦。\n提壶劝人但饮酒，百岁称觞为君寿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56082,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悲铜驼","author":"胡奎","text":"悲铜驼，洛阳桃李春风多。\n千乘万骑陌上过，流光衮衮东逝波。\n铜盘露冷铜仙去，忍见铜驼埋棘处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56083,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野田雀","author":"胡奎","text":"野田雀，鸣啾啾。\n啄我黍，何时休。\n我黍半输官，我黍半养家。\n尔雀群飞无网罗，我黍日减雀日多。\n野田雀，奈尔何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56084,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艾如张二首 其一","author":"胡奎","text":"野田黄雀朝暮飞，碧云茫茫艾叶肥。\n少年张罗雀不知，误触毛羽鸣声悲。\n凤凰翱翔千仞冈，五色文采鸣朝阳。\n托巢蓬莱白玉树，此生安识艾如张。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56085,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艾如张二首 其二","author":"胡奎","text":"东山有凤，西山有麟。\n张罗于野，其心匪仁。\n天池之鹏，扶摇直上。\n翼如垂云，安畏尔网。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56086,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"婆饼焦","author":"胡奎","text":"婆饼焦，阿婆有饼教妾烧。\n妾烧饼焦婆不食，上堂见婆无颜色。\n不学姑恶死怨姑，深林日夕鸣相呼。\n但愿麦黄婆有饼，年年唤婆欲婆醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56087,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"姑恶词","author":"胡奎","text":"姑恶叫青春，声声恼杀人。\n啼时休近户，妾恐老姑瞋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56088,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中乌","author":"胡奎","text":"雪中乌，雪中乌，城头积雪白模糊。\n天寒失其巢，哑哑无宇居。\n巢中有雏尾毕逋，雏不见母母忆雏。\n雪中乌，孤复孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56089,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"琼州乌","author":"胡奎","text":"琼州乌，夜夜夜啼琼树枝，一朝雄死遗孤雌。\n为母在秦川，日望天南啼复啼。\n如何母与子，同天不同栖。\n雏今海南去，勿恋琼州树，秦川故巢不相依。\n母挟子，早来归，东海燕燕待子飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56090,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乌生八九子","author":"胡奎","text":"乌生八九子，朝栖城上树，暮饮城下水。\n母昔翩翩引子飞，子今啄啄哺母饥。\n子多不愁哺母食，夜夜来巢城树枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56091,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乌夜啼","author":"胡奎","text":"乌夜啼，城上头。\n城中少妇弹箜篌。\n起闻乌啼生远愁。\n乌不能言解乌意，愿乌啼时赦书至。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":56092,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]